--- !u!114 &10729868
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 10729866}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f58b49e4622794818a5c8709faebf06a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BookContent
  text: 'Hey, kiddo. I started packing up the smaller things so that when the movers
    come all you have to do is tell them what furniture you want to keep. The real
    estate agency will rearrange the rest when they get the house ready for showing.
    I tried to get into your parents'' office to find the deed, but it was locked.
    Note on the door said something about a spare key but I could not find it for
    the life of me. Classic Oscar. Also- be careful of the security system, I got
    locked in a room the other day and had to call a locksmith.

    Let me know
    if you need anything.


    -Dave'
